    "title": "Calling Me - fun video chat",
    "description": "Calling Me is a fun app for video calls and live chat! Here you can discover friends across the world, and video chat with them to your heart\u2019s content.\r\n \r\nHighlight Features:\r\n\ud83d\udcac Fun video chat\r\n- You can enjoy live video calls on your phone at your leisure.\r\n- HD video quality and fast connection speed.\r\n- Blur feature is automatically applied when no face is detected\r\n\ud83c\udf9e\ufe0f Latest posts\r\n- Discover people all over the world and what\u2019s new in their lives\r\n- Talk to whoever you want and broaden your friend circle.\r\n- Post amazing moments in your own life\r\n\ud83d\ude04 Awesome people\r\n- Our community boasts users from all over the globe.\r\n- In Calling Me private chat rooms, distance is not a barrier anymore!\r\n \r\nAt Calling Me, we believe in true friendship and kind social gestures, but if you encounter anyone or anything unpleasant, feel free to contact our customer service team. We hope you have a great time here!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Calling Me is a fun app for video calls and live chat! Here you can discover friends across the world, and video chat with them to your heart\u2019s content.<br> <br>Highlight Features:<br>\ud83d\udcac Fun video chat<br>- You can enjoy live video calls on your phone at your leisure.<br>- HD video quality and fast connection speed.<br>- Blur feature is automatically applied when no face is detected<br>\ud83c\udf9e\ufe0f Latest posts<br>- Discover people all over the world and what\u2019s new in their lives<br>- Talk to whoever you want and broaden your friend circle.<br>- Post amazing moments in your own life<br>\ud83d\ude04 Awesome people<br>- Our community boasts users from all over the globe.<br>- In Calling Me private chat rooms, distance is not a barrier anymore!<br> <br>At Calling Me, we believe in true friendship and kind social gestures, but if you encounter anyone or anything unpleasant, feel free to contact our customer service team. We hope you have a great time here!",
